    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "There is no options type",
      "items": [
        "The customisation surface is the three registration methods",
        "Every one is idempotent \u2014 a second call adds nothing",
        "Each cipher method throws for a blank key"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Key handling",
      "items": [
        "A cipher registration is a singleton over the key you passed",
        "Rotating the key means new configuration and a restart",
        "The package stores no key and offers no rotation"
      ]
    }
